sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Node as dPKMS Node
    participant SQLite as Local SQLite
    participant Outbox as Job Outbox
    participant Cloud as Cloud Sync<br/>PostgreSQL
    participant IPFS as IPFS Cluster
    participant Arweave as Arweave Network
    participant Blockchain as Solana/Ethereum

    User->>Node: ctxt add "content"
    activate Node

    Node->>Node: Create KnowledgeObject
    Node->>SQLite: Write locally
    activate SQLite
    SQLite-->>Node: ✓ Stored
    deactivate SQLite

    Note over Node,Blockchain: Async Outbox Jobs Created

    Node->>Outbox: Enqueue SyncToCloud
    Node->>Outbox: Enqueue PinToIPFS
    Node->>Outbox: Enqueue ArchiveToArweave
    Node->>Outbox: Enqueue AnchorToBlockchain

    deactivate Node

    par Parallel Execution
        rect rgb(200, 230, 201)
        Outbox->>Cloud: 1. Serialize + Compress
        Cloud->>Cloud: Verify checksum
        Cloud-->>Outbox: ✓ Synced
        end

        rect rgb(179, 229, 252)
        Outbox->>IPFS: 2. Package as CAR
        IPFS->>IPFS: Add + Pin
        IPFS->>IPFS: Publish to DHT
        IPFS-->>Outbox: ✓ CID: Qm...
        end

        rect rgb(255, 204, 188)
        Outbox->>Arweave: 3. Bundle with others
        Arweave->>Arweave: Submit to bundler
        Arweave-->>Outbox: ✓ TX: ArXXX
        end

        rect rgb(255, 224, 178)
        Outbox->>Blockchain: 4. Create commit
        Blockchain->>Blockchain: Sign with keypair
        Blockchain->>Blockchain: Submit transaction
        Blockchain-->>Outbox: ✓ Signature: 0x...
        end
    end

    Outbox->>SQLite: Mark jobs completed
    Note over SQLite: Object is now in:<br/>✓ Local SQLite<br/>✓ Cloud DB<br/>✓ IPFS Network<br/>✓ Arweave (permanent)<br/>✓ Blockchain (anchored)

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
    Note over User,Blockchain: READ PATH (Retrieval)
    User->>Node: ctxt find "query"
    activate Node
    Node->>SQLite: 1. Search local FTS5
    SQLite-->>Node: Local results
    par Parallel Retrieval
        Node->>Cloud: 2a. Search cloud DB
        Cloud-->>Node: Cloud results
        Node->>IPFS: 2b. DHT lookup
        IPFS-->>Node: IPFS results
        Node->>Blockchain: 2c. Query events
        Blockchain-->>Node: On-chain results
    end
    Node->>Node: 3. Merge + Deduplicate
    Node->>Node: 4. Rerank by profile
    Node-->>User: Ranked results with provenance
    deactivate Node
    end
